      "value": "I doubt that it has been overlooked. There was a request years ago from mimi to whitelist the car prefab from the standard assets. So the devs are aware of cars. I think it is of rather low priority to fix stuff regarding 3rd party assets. I managed to lower the audio by just moving the slider in the audio source of the prefab to the left and applied it to the asset. It is for some reason only active when you press the play button. And I limited the range of all audio on the cars to 25 units. But maybe some stupid update broke stuff again and I'm wrong here. Didn't look much into it for some time now.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
