      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5d9603c3afbf562cffbbee87|full_name}: I took a look at Tsumuri karts and there it works. I still have the problem that the car is audible on the entire map. Not too loud but I could not get rid of it and it is distracting if you are not driving and hear a constant engine sound. Maybe it is just the old prefab I use and I should redo it from scratch.\nEDIT: after adding the latest sdk and adding an audio source and the new spacializer it is not audible on the entire map anymore. And the world audio can be used to silence them.",
